## 💡 Why YTcF?

YouTube's algorithm often surfaces content that's irrelevant, low-quality, or repetitive. YTcF hands control back to you — beyond classic channel and keyword filtering, it adds precise per-page-type filtering rules, automatic collaboration-video splitting, and a hard-block mode, suited to everything from distraction-free browsing to family/kids-safe setups.

## ✨ Key Features

- **🚫 Channel blocklist / whitelist**: Match by UC ID, `@handle`, channel name, or Regex
- **🎬 Single-video blocklist**: Block a specific video by ID without touching the rest of the channel
- **🤝 Smart collaboration-video parsing**: Automatically splits cross-channel collab videos so you can block just one participant
- **⭐ Whitelist-only mode**: One toggle for a minimal, trusted-channels-only, kid-friendly view
- **🔤 Keyword groups + Regex**: Match title and/or description, with advanced regular expression support
- **⏱️ Multi-dimensional filters**: Duration, view count, upload date, language (BCP-47), live/upcoming, members-only, fundraisers
- **🎯 Filter Scope matrix** (advanced): 11 rule types × page types (home, subscriptions, search, watch, channel, etc.), independently toggled
- **🛡️ Direct-access hard block**: Force-pause and overlay-block when a blocked channel/video is opened via a direct URL or external link
- **🖱️ Quick actions**: Hover action bar, native ⋮ menu integration, global floating button
- **🔬 Diagnostics**: Per-card lifecycle tracing and a 10,000-entry debug log ring buffer, so bug reports come with real evidence
- **💾 Full backup/export/share**: Complete JSON backup, CSV export, one-click shareable links

See the full user guide below for detailed usage.

