## PIN Lock

Enable PIN Lock in the ⚙️ Settings panel under "PIN Lock":

- Once set, opening the management panel requires entering the PIN
- While locked, all tabs and the global on/off toggle are disabled
- The panel automatically re-locks when closed
- The "Remove from blocklist" button on the Blocker overlay screen also requires PIN verification (independently — it does not inherit the panel's unlocked state)

