## Bug Reports & Diagnostics

If you run into flickering, filters not working, or delayed card updates:

1. Open the management panel and switch to the User Guide tab, or use "🔬 Enable Diagnostic Mode" from the Tampermonkey extension menu
2. Click "🪲 Start Recording Issue" and reproduce the problem
3. Click "⏹️ Stop & Export Log" to download the diagnostic log (`ytcf-diag-xxx.log`)
4. Open a report on [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/hubig21/YouTube-Gatekeeper/issues) and attach the log file

---

## Notes

- The script only filters **video cards on listing pages** — it does not affect the actual content of videos being played
- YouTube Shorts are not in scope; use a dedicated Shorts filter script (e.g., Hide YouTube Shorts, UnHook) alongside this one
- When a channel page contains no UC ID, matching relies primarily on `@handle` and channel name
- If a blocked channel's cards still appear, try refreshing the page or clicking "Save Settings" in the panel
- Settings are stored in the browser's localStorage — please export a backup before clearing browser data

